      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喂，你快来看看这棵树的树干。这是熊的爪印吧？\r\n这可是真真正正的狠家伙啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7440132812e17194d7da2a031a8e2227168a6c41c7fd9344fdbf21b342c119ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
