    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8452890aad436854299043",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我在说些什么蠢话啊。现在应该离开才是……\r\n不对。我明明已经早就知道自己是在拽着她一起跳入深渊，\r\n为何现在还不——",
      "source_fingerprint": "94093c31be148c41e4a1e9fbe12ac29e0a2e096fc52869564c1c226fdbe01d74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
