    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4ca64dce3104516863c02d6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自远处传来什么生物的低吼声，接着是草木被成排压倒的声音。\r\n有什么东西正试图悄悄接近我们……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "974baef2c79d4d13ae00ae2a7e985f7ee6d27378e350f39ec1b2dc408b4e6052",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
