    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c8a7c9410523459a223c5ae",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……哈，这么快就跟过来了。\r\n看来今天还真是走了狗屎运啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca2c6846481bef7d859b96b52b40c0bf72edd01b1056956a6ceda90077468fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
