    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b2903b445d4585b5abaccd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们狂奔在漆黑的森林之中，眼前所见也仅有黑暗。\r\n有勇无谋。不计后果。这就是场尽过人事之后只能听天命的豪赌。\r\n就算这样……不。只有这样——",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce673491f88f7afccd4bb91c9b870c8204ec1fadcccc3b9966c101e2dbbfb453",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ea8bdcf7f4387fc1fc9b23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……对了，就是这个。就得是这个……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "73afe90f394eb8fbc55ca693c9795a6d6e1fc5fcd0b6d18473cde2d65c86f140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278a5c213f3de792d4586620",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "奔跑。逃亡。野兽狂乱的呼吸声与撼地的脚步声交响于耳畔。\r\n捕食者的气息开始逼近。与死神赛跑的刺激开始令我的大脑麻痹、\r\n思想也开始逐渐融化——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f86093e0f90da60b424488a651c21b1b0c97c02f0ae9b0af9af2caf96f18c31",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb6a665055d9dc6aa9ffe8d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13c15c75ffcc8f823b9b92ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈！！喂，你还听得见吗？\r\n这很不妙吧？很不妙对吧？！\r\n好啦，之后还有更猛的在等着呢！要冲刺咯！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbb85903d6244e941c9be41e1d62cdd931fe3f089d180af731f13dd95bc4878d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927d51037ada47d3270c4c30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我察觉到自己被她抓住之前，深陷于黑暗中的天地便上下翻转了。\r\n中山庆典一把将我抱了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21b48ae06888b7bcda249c3c9118022fb00b87d40b25bcb50a8b012c9380f1c9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c57d6987a95a6ee751cde2ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c8adf33ceb94dbda2ead492",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "噢啦啊啊啊啊！！！！该决胜负了！！！！\r\n追得上来的话就追过来试试看吧！！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ed76079afc22880e184d4be1f3143a1dc6f759dc3222fc8d06d782311f7c8de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4402a3231939c818972df7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典忘我地冲刺着，仿佛她此生从未奔跑过。\r\n野兽的气息逐渐消失……接着，黑暗骤然褪去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "764f61d95911590af607f122899a1b4bd46762a53f0abd0f2ce9ed5a437c9cfe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83ed9adc7bd74fcf1e33773b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
