      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97758b06946191dd1ffc7047",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们跪倒在沙滩之上，就像疯子一般狂笑着。\r\n在狂笑之际，我的手再一次不自觉地颤抖起来。\r\n奇怪啊，实在是太奇怪了——",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5fbba6536db78ddc790f91e3d70ab975d101f7eca4104647450c76f45a4dd57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
