    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d904da57d96511378621c42a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那时候也是，而现在也一样，我的手脚都颤抖不已。\r\n这一切全因那根本称不上“得体”的感觉。这并非是恐怖，而是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5d52ac21151e3f88f173fd34cd9d78b6104c6c04707a80e48b3f03c7019bc52",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
