    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3581380b6933812d04218e10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我茫然地跟着中山庆典一起，向着森林深处走去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "838027d560f638b42ca94d7cdae26325985264f3c0048aea9cd06596b2d050c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8c5051533ea7eaa89c911e7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "残月点燃凄凉的月光、在漆黑如墨、波浪四起的海面上铺出一条明亮的光路。\r\n而在我们头顶上，让人震撼到无法言语的银河正横卧于夜空。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97651f6560aab955ef98326d9f65558af672444e23d211344a7c9a50e76175ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17268b9948de59416bbb921b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这就是我们在这场赌上性命的赌局中拿下的报酬。\r\n兴奋和喜悦再也无法抑制。我浑身颤抖着，暗叹自己的堕落。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d278153839bab776ec16cc7af5542c9561938b70a5a12ca1e9474cd46fd1d2b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1c5c72e6bdcc30922e70591",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我说……咱们接下来要赌什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42949a84bec647a60aa73e42e2fd57417ca79fc9cf18d44a5d60a29423cf152c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
