    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3300dfc2bbe17a4d655dc36",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……就跟我一起堕落吧，",
      "source_fingerprint": "5832e2cff36983faeb60f2e194e49bffaa3a3e6f1b3bd21c13eeb0ca0d53a8dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:967bed8546d027015af58ffb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我无言地点点头。我们还得继续前进才行——\r\n直到跌倒之日、直到崩溃之日、直到身死之日来临，\r\n我们都将携着深不见底的不安与让人汗毛倒立的兴奋一起，继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f0f970348461bda1ad68f93214f5a53ec52fa300f6cdecb3aebd4e22d9e1618",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:565c8f85a16b5615330728ac",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……差不多也该说一下要去哪儿了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b65ac32525e95e76daa5dd8be1bbc920967583a62838f26a2dc22f84b2d7d37",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6010c9e367100c97b020476a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "中山庆典",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c202db2755a9750c0769d373f4610457612e8abd3feb5044ef7914f3c657dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
