    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faeb982b6fdbb9c39ee6517f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……森林对面的沙滩。听说那可是个堪称绝景的地方。\r\n不过有这片森林拦在这里，就连当地人都不怎么能去到那里呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a81aba01407e8c4669bbe5f0ee56a94565b2b50c1bb54747d93dfacb1960de8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
