    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf54fdd889088f336204426b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "筹码是『我们二人』，报酬是『绝美的景色』。\r\n前面到底是刀山呢，还是火海呢——",
      "source_fingerprint": "711ab3d22542f2ba94b790354c248b6de6cbf88368bf582a7ac00724f5aa1872",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
