      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38313826301d7da5d462caf7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毫无人烟的森林中满是茂盛到令人不安的高大草木，完全遮挡了我们的视野。\r\n……这一行为甚至算得上是自寻死路，身为训练员的我应该阻止她才对。但——",
      "source_fingerprint": "868977fdef048525895012c069c1d8585ca0866d6acf08bde52f1bdef5abde0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1049/storytimeline_041049007.json",
      "json_path": [
