    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d14f72b31f6f30817f33f97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在平静祥和的餐厅中，突然响起一阵格格不入的怒吼声。\n整个餐厅瞬间因此而安静下来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8f74b3e0d72f20b9a66dd7e68b2d017cbab1937f1ea09e324f23073e81c968f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
